# Local database dumps -- flagged by an independent architecture review (2026-07-14): an
# untracked raw SQL dump (backups/novalight-pre-clerk-activation-20260713-161622.sql) was sitting
# in the working tree with nothing preventing it from being swept into a future `git add -A`.
# Database dumps may contain real data and must never be committed.
backups/

# Environment files -- broadened during M1.5 planning after independent risk review found
# .env.production (and similar) were NOT actually excluded at the repo root or in apps/api
# under the previous narrower patterns (only apps/web/.gitignore had a real .env* wildcard).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
